   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "So that, in order that",
     "texto": [
      "**Pour que** and **afin que** (so that) introduce a purpose: **Je viens pour que tu sois content** (I'm coming so that you are happy).",
      "With an infinitive, by contrast, the subject is the same: **Je viens pour te voir** (I'm coming to see you)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Other expressions with the subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "**Avant que** (before), **sans que** (without), **pourvu que** (as long as), **à condition que** (on condition that): **Je viendrai à condition que tu sois là** (I'll come on condition that you are there)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
